---

## 💡 What I Learned

- Using `background-image` with multiple SVG files to add decorative patterns:

```css
body {
  background-image:
    url("images/bg-pattern-top-mobile.svg"),
    url("images/bg-pattern-bottom-mobile.svg");
  background-position:
    top left,
    bottom right;
  background-repeat: no-repeat, no-repeat;
}
```

- Creating a staggered layout using the CSS `translate` property with `nth-of-type`:

```css
.clients-comments-sec article:nth-of-type(2) {
  translate: 0 calc(var(--Size-1) * 2);
}
.clients-comments-sec article:nth-of-type(3) {
  translate: 0 calc(var(--Size-1) * 4);
}
```

- The difference between `margin` and `translate`:
  - `margin` pushes surrounding elements away
  - `translate` moves the element itself without affecting others

